bplist00�XUTI-Data�[public.htmlO'�<meta charset='utf-8'><div class="xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a" style="white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-inline: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(226, 229, 233); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(37, 39, 40); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div dir="auto" style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start;">Profiilin takana häärää Teija "Tytti" Tarkkanen  ent. Juntto 48 vuotias nainen Riihimäeltä.</div></div><div class="x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a" style="white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-inline: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0.5em; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(226, 229, 233); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(37, 39, 40); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div dir="auto" style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start;">Koiria ollut vuodesta 1988.</div><div dir="auto" style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start;">Ensimmäinen laji oli toko , jossa olen kouluttanut 3 x tottelevaisuusvalion .  Yhteensä olen saavuttanut 79 erikoisvoittajaluokan ykköstulosta. </div><div dir="auto" style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start;">Tokon maajoukkueessa kisasin vuosina 2005-2007. Tokon koulutusohjaajana olen toiminut vuodesta 1995.</div></div><div class="x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a" style="white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-inline: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0.5em; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(226, 229, 233); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(37, 39, 40); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div dir="auto" style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start;">Tokon lisäksi koiraharrastus vei palveluskoira puolelle. </div><div dir="auto" style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start;">Olen käynyt kolmosluokan kokeissa omakouluttamalla koiralla etsintäkokeessa, jäljellä ,haussa ja viestillä . </div><div dir="auto" style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start;">Käyttövaliot minulla on viestiltä ja hakukokeesta </div><div dir="auto" style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start;">Minulle on myönnetty :</div></div><div class="x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a" style="white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-inline: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0.5em; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(226, 229, 233); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(37, 39, 40); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div dir="auto" style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start;">-palveluskoirien hopeinen ansiomerkki</div><div dir="auto" style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start;">-Australianpaimenkoirat ry  hopeinen ansiomerkki  -Suursnautserien pronssinen harrastusmerkki (ilman että olen koskaan omistanut tai ohjannut jo rodun koiraa )</div></div><div class="x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a" style="white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-inline: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0.5em; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(226, 229, 233); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(37, 39, 40); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div dir="auto" style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start;">Olen kasvattanut australianpaimenkoiria vuodesta 2001 kennelnimellä Särkivaaran .</div></div><div class="x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a" style="white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-inline: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0.5em; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(226, 229, 233); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(37, 39, 40); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div dir="auto" style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start;">Olen koulutellut muita viikoittain omissa ryhmissä vuodesta 1995. Leireillä olen kouluttanut silloin tällöin,kun kyselyjä on tullut.</div></div><div class="x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a" style="white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-inline: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0.5em; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(226, 229, 233); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(37, 39, 40); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div dir="auto" style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start;">Tällä hetkellä kotona asuu neljännen ja viidennen polven omia koiria:</div><div dir="auto" style="font-family: inherit; text-align: start;">Australianpaimenkoirat</div></div><div class="x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a" style="white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-inline: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0.5em; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;.SFNSText-Regular&quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(226, 229, 233); font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(37, 39, 40); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><div dir="auto" style="font-family: inherit; text-align: star